# Primal Witchstalker under an opponent's The Water Crystal with six cards in its controller's library: "mill four cards"
# becomes "mill eight" (CR 614.1a, 614.6), the library holds six, and all six are milled (CR 701.17b). The instruction as
# replaced was not carried out in full, so "when you do" does not trigger (CR 603.12; the project owner's ruling,
# 2026-11-05, as Wick's Patrol's ruling has it for a short library): no Island returns, though four or more were milled.
# Positive controls: primal-witchstalker-under-the-water-crystal-with-eight-cards-*, and -mills-eight-and-still-returns-a-land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Primal Witchstalker
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
The Water Crystal
Island x20

[Actions]
